# MAESTRO example: LTU Festo MPS - shared reference data
# core/product.ttl: statements that belong to the MAESTRO product module (https://w3id.org/maestro/product).
# Umbrella: ../shared.ttl. Single-file form of the use case: ../shared-merged.ttl.

@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
